              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Names and Callables",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`g = f`: two names, ==one object==",
                "`callable(obj)` is True for functions, classes, objects with `__call__`"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Function as dict value?** It is an ordinary object",
                "**What makes it callable?** A `__call__` method",
