          "title": "Scope (LEGB) and Closures",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. LEGB and Rebinding",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Local",
                    "sub": "inside def",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Enclosing",
                    "sub": "outer def",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Global",
                    "sub": "module",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Built-in",
                    "sub": "len, print",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "First ==match wins==; no match raises `NameError`",
                "Assigning anywhere in a def makes the name ==local== for the whole function",
                "Reading it before the assignment raises `UnboundLocalError`",
                "`global x` / `nonlocal x` only to ==rebind==; reading or mutating needs neither"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Closures and Late Binding",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Closure== = inner function keeping outer variables after the outer returns",
                "Captured cells show in `f.__closure__`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "def counter():",
                "    n = 0",
                "    def inc():",
                "        nonlocal n",
                "        n += 1",
                "        return n",
                "    return inc",
                "c = counter(); c(); print(c(), c.__closure__[0].cell_contents)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "2 2"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Late-binding trap",
              "text": "Closures capture the __variable__, not its value. `[lambda: i for i in range(3)]` all return ==2==. Fix: `lambda i=i: i`"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**What is LEGB?** Local, Enclosing, Global, Built-in lookup order",
                "**nonlocal vs global?** Rebinds an outer-function name vs a module name",
                "**Loop lambdas all return 2?** They share `i`; bind it with `i=i`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
